# 2. Gmail App-Specific Password (16 characters, without spaces)
# To generate a Gmail App Password:
#   a) Go to your Google Account at https://myaccount.google.com/
#   b) Navigate to Security -> 2-Step Verification (must be turned ON).
#   c) Scroll to the bottom and select "App passwords".
